Check that USP stack is handling the reconnection scenario properly PCF-1198/PPW-65 by restarting obuspa:

  $ R "service obuspa restart" ; sleep 20

Check that obuspa provides the same datamodel again (minus the platform specific WiFi Vendor extensions):

  $ R "obuspa -f /etc/obuspa.db -c dump datamodel | grep '^Device.' | grep -v -e 'Device.WiFi.AccessPoint.{i}.Vendor.' -e 'Device.WiFi.EndPoint.{i}.Vendor.' -e 'Device.WiFi.Radio.{i}.Vendor.' -e 'Device.WiFi.Radio.{i}.NaStaMonitor.'"
